  "concept": {"zh": "双摆节拍 · 空中梯", "en": "Two rhythms · Sky stairs"},
  "brief": {
    "zh": "在钟声响完前登上东北角的顶台。长梯上的两排摆锤会打出脉冲。西排从第 1 回合起每三回合发亮。东排从第 2 回合起每四回合发亮。中层两头各有一条上楼的梯道。东南角的钟舌钥匙能打开顶台的舱口。限 43 回合。",
    "en": "Reach the northeast rooftop before the bells fall silent. Two rows of pendulums send pulses across the landings. The west row flashes every third turn starting on turn 1. The east row flashes every fourth turn starting on turn 2. Stairs at both ends of the middle landing lead upstairs. The clapper key in the southeast opens the rooftop hatch. Finish within 43 turns."
  },
